    "body": "We used an offline VM running a copy of our Agie Classic Cut 2S machine control. In the loaded 20 mm Berco punch, the work editor displayed the requested Ra target of 0.35 µm. The control plotted the rough cut and three trims. This test verified the selected target and motion. Measuring the resulting surface finish requires a physical cut. See #2999 for the check on repeat import.\n",
